---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { email } from '../../data/products';
---

<Layout
  title="Accessibility statement"
  description="Accessibility features, evaluation scope, and known evaluation limits for the RCLabs public product site."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">RCLabs</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Accessibility statement</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">ACCESSIBILITY / PUBLIC PRODUCT SITE</p>
      <h1>
        Make the details
        <span class="muted">accessible to everyone.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Our target is all applicable WCAG 2.2 A, AA, and AAA criteria.
        Evaluation is in progress. We do not currently claim conformance.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section prose">
    <h2>Scope and current status</h2>
    <p>
      This statement covers the public hub, Atheros Search page, Schema Migrator
      page, demo request page, and this statement, including synthetic
      demonstrations. It does not cover the authenticated product consoles or
      your email application.
    </p>
    <p>
      Automated tests are only part of the evidence. VoiceOver with Safari, NVDA
      with Firefox, and usability sessions with disabled participants remain
      required before any conformance claim.
    </p>
    <h2>Read in the way that works for you</h2>
    <p>
      Open Reading &amp; display settings above the main content to choose light
      or dark appearance, larger text, a narrower line width, comfortable
      spacing, and reduced movement. Browser zoom, custom styles, and
      operating-system motion preferences are supported.
    </p>
    <h2>Use the site with a keyboard</h2>
    <p>
      Press Tab to reach links and controls. The first link skips to the main
      content. Use Enter or Space to expand details and activate buttons. Use
      arrow keys in selection controls. No demo has a time limit.
    </p>
    <h2>Understand the examples</h2>
    <p>
      All product examples use synthetic data. Diagrams have text descriptions.
      The migration demo includes every step in an expandable text version.
      Specialist terms are explained on each product page.
    </p>
    <h2>Report a barrier</h2>
    <p>
      Email{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=Accessibility%20feedback`}>{email}</a>{' '}
      with the page, the task you were trying to complete, and any browser or
      assistive technology details you want to share. Please avoid including
      private network data or credentials.
    </p>
    <h2>Evaluation record</h2>
    <p>
      The repository maintains a criterion-by-criterion evidence matrix and a
      release checklist. This statement will be updated after the complete
      scoped evaluation. WCAG 3 is a draft and is not the acceptance standard
      for this site.
    </p>
    <p>
      Learn about{' '}
      <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/">
        WCAG 2.2 from the World Wide Web Consortium
      </a>
      .
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
